  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-10-11T16:18:08-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, October 11, 2018, 4:18 pm\">October 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2>The Cape Cod Art Center, Barnstable Mass announced acceptance of artists in their Annual Juried Show, “The All New England”</h2>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-4036 size-large\" src=\"/media/archive/90629c140aa39b3390f0386483f0b1bbf3caa77e12db9541b5b9aa4095ea6b4d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>Guild members whose work will be exhibited: Anne Briggs, Larry Folding, Martha Little Fuentes, Doris Mee, and Brian Powers. Show Dates: October 15 – November 11, Reception: Thursday, October, 5 – 7:00p.m.</p>\n<p></p><p data-fidelity-note=\"embed\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2978.9100731429216!2d-70.29645568404183!3d41.70087697923669!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x89fb36de81db0255%3A0x6a7f6820112f8639!2sCape+Cod+Art+Center!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1539288828643\">Open the original embedded content</a></p><p></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-74004cd9be5de0d40a61/\" rel=\"tag\">EVENTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-252f1ae48dd294e4f06d/\" rel=\"tag\">Anne Briggs</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-92158243fa16c3a439ab/\" rel=\"tag\">Brian Powers</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-f2a631a3e003de1b1e3a/\" rel=\"tag\">Cape Cod Art Center</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-ca2a1c0bde236338a43a/\" rel=\"tag\">Doris Mee</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-0f38b00007a5ec9728b6/\" rel=\"tag\">Larry Folding</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-55e09a88f1feffe4fd22/\" rel=\"tag\">Martha Little Fuentes</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
